  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Leaving No One Behind: Building Pathways for Peace in the North East via engagement of Civil Society and Youth Leaders</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The action seeks to contribute to the promotion of peace and security in North East India, through inclusive partnerships and by expanding space for engagement of civil society and youth leaders in three States in North East India (Assam, Manipur, Nagaland).</narrative>
  </description>
